---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Bukjum | Recycling Materials Aggregator & Processor in Osun State, Nigeria & Africa" 
  description="Bukjum buys, sells, and processes recycling materials—including plastics (PET, HDPE, PP), paper, glass, and iron—linking buyers and sellers across Osun State, Nigeria, and Africa."
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">RECYCLING AGGREGATOR & PROCESSOR — OSUN STATE, NIGERIA & AFRICA</p>
      <h1>Buying, selling & processing<br /><em>recycling materials.</em></h1>
      <p>Headquartered in Osun State, Nigeria, Bukjum processes recyclable commodities and connects verified buyers and sellers of plastics, paper, glass, and iron across Nigeria and Africa.</p>
      
      <div style="margin-top: 2rem; display: flex; gap: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap;">
        <a href="/products/" class="button button-primary">Browse Materials</a>
        <a href="/buyers/" class="button button-secondary">Request Quotation</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Explore Marketplace Portals</h2>
      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem;">
        <div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
          <h3>For Industrial Buyers</h3>
          <p>Source processed and aggregated plastics (PET, HDPE, PP), paper, glass, and iron in bulk quantities (10+ tonnes) across Nigeria and Africa.</p>
          <a href="/buyers/">Enquire as a Buyer →</a>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
          <h3>For Recycling Suppliers</h3>
          <p>Sell collected plastics, paper, glass, and scrap iron directly to our Osun State processing hub or connect with verified industrial buyers.</p>
          <a href="/suppliers/">Supply Materials →</a>
        </div>
        <div style="border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 8px;">
          <h3>Material Processing & Aggregation</h3>
          <p>We sort, process, and aggregate recyclable commodities in Osun State to ensure reliable volume and consistent industrial quality.</p>
          <a href="/products/">View Material Catalogue →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>